'''Ornament2''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
Its blade is blue in color with golden swirls and snowflakes on it alongside its shiny silver edge. The guard is golden, and the handle is blue with vintage golden designs and snowflakes on it.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Ornament2 (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ornament2_Set Ornament2 Set].

